# Route cheats_pad_stagger — cheats_pad.pad with the chord pressed the way a hand does: SELECT first, START 3 vblanks later (inside the pad menu's
# 8-vblank hold-back window), both held 12; two Downs because reset-to-track adds a mod row before the cheats rows; for tools/mod_cheats_check.sh --pad-reset (reset-to-track enabled: it must never see that Select).
# Pages: see chase.pad. Waits for the game, not for a time (host/pad_sequence.hpp); times after the last WAIT count from the race's own pages.
